      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town grew at the junction of the Great Indian Warpath and Daniel Boone’s Wilderness Road, a key spot in America’s westward expansion.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
